WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Use example sentences as hints in matching tasks.. Read paragraph openings first

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
and build a map.. Do not decide True or False until you find the exact line..

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
The answer that looks too familiar is often the trap.. If you skip a gap, mark

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
it and move on.. Read the header row before filling a table.. In matching, the

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
sentence repeating the same word is usually a distractor.. Give TFNG a calm two

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
minutes instead of rushing.. In listening, underline the keywords and wait for

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
the audio.. Do not waste time switching caps in listening answers..
